Control-like line starts, quotes and backslashes remain data.
-- input.html --
<h1>Quotes &quot;and&quot; \ paths</h1>
<h2>.danger &quot;heading&quot;</h2>
<p>.danger<br>'also-danger<br>\f[B] &quot;quoted&quot; &amp; x&nbsp;y</p>
<pre><code>.so /etc/passwd
'include secret
\*[name]
last</code></pre>
